   "width": 280,
   "height": 80
  },
  {
   "id": "rtph060000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## 6 · MVP jogável",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 80
  },
  {
   "id": "rtph070000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Depois",
   "x": 2440,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 80,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "rtrw000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### Técnico",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 160,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc0000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Monorepo, Git LFS\n- Projeto Unity vazio\n- Solução .NET (core, sim, tests, server)",
   "x": 200,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc1000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Core + simulador + testes\n- d20, graus, 3 ações, grid, ataque de oportunidade, semente\n- [[motor-de-regras]] · [[combate]]",
   "x": 520,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc2000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Unity anima o registro de eventos\n- Troca de equipamento\n- Automático e IA dos inimigos\n- [[personagem]] · [[combate]]",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc3000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Servidor .NET + PostgreSQL\n- Login local (Steam depois)\n- Salvar e reconectar\n- [[03-tecnico]]",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc4000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Zona e grid exportado\n- Grupos visíveis, luta no lugar\n- Coleta por nó, refino, craft, carga, durabilidade\n- [[mundo]] · [[oficios-e-economia]] · [[durabilidade-e-morte]]",
   "x": 1480,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc5000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Tutorial como máquina de estados\n- NPCs, contratos, chefe\n- [[02-travessia]]",
   "x": 1800,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc6000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Steamworks\n- Corrigir o que o teste mostrar",
   "x": 2120,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc7000000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- PvP com eco\n- Diário e desafio periódico",
   "x": 2440,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 240
  },
  {
   "id": "rtrw010000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "### Cliente",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 400,
   "width": 160,
   "height": 200
  },
  {
   "id": "rtc2100000000000",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "- Arena com grid\n- Personagem placeholder\n- Barra de ações e log da luta",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 400,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 200
  },
  {
